<title>UK: T&amp;N piston director sold shares at 172p each.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N piston director sold shares at 172p each.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British components group T&amp;N Plc said on Tuesday that its director Allan Welsh had sold 2,371 shares in the company on the last day of 1996 at a price of 172 pence each.</p>
<p>The company made the announcment in a standard regulatory submission to the stock exchange. Welsh is chief executive of the group's piston products arm.</p>
<p>During Tuesday T&amp;N shares were marked up one penny in an otherwise weak stock market to stand at 178 pence at 1455 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
